## What breaks

booking-v3 prints `MM/DD/YYYY` under its date field. Customers of day-first tenants on booking-v3
type the month first, as told, and the form reads it day first. Only the form channel, only
booking-v3. The parser fix ([#1](/kb/incidents/1)) does not touch it.

## Outcome

**Won't fix**: booking-v3 is retired; #4471 closed on 5 October.

